# OR Books Stencil theme

When working under `orbooks-theme/`, read **`docs/agents/stencil-theme.md`** first.

## Hard rules

- Run Stencil CLI from `orbooks-theme/`.
- Never commit or echo `secrets.stencil.json` / access tokens.
- Store URL = storefront homepage (`https://www.orbooks.com`), not the API `/v3/` path.
- This theme is **not** Briefboard (`app/`). Prefer separate git repo; do not mix theme dumps into Briefboard history without an explicit user decision.

## Homepage category IDs (agent-owned — do not ask the human)

Committed `config.json` = **prod** IDs (`new=322`, `sale=323`). Staging = `111` / `112`.

- Staging local or **staging push**: `node scripts/apply-homepage-ids.js staging` → do work / push → `node scripts/apply-homepage-ids.js prod`
- **Prod push**: `node scripts/apply-homepage-ids.js prod` first (restores committed IDs). Never push `111`/`112`
- Never commit staging IDs into `config.json`

Full note: `docs/agents/stencil-theme.md` → **Homepage category IDs**.

## Local customLayouts (do not rediscover)

Production template associations are **not** imported by `stencil pull` / `download`. Local map = `config.stencil.json` → `customLayouts`.

- **Refresh:** `node scripts/harvest-custom-layouts.js --apply` (from `orbooks-theme/`) — public storefront GETs only; writes `customLayouts.from-api.json` + overwrites `customLayouts`.
- **Dump is regenerable** — do not hand-edit `customLayouts.from-api.json` or the bulk author URL list; re-harvest when authors drift.
- Fat `customLayouts` (all single-author URLs) is **intentional**. Restart `stencil start` after apply.

Details: `docs/agents/stencil-theme.md` → **Refresh local customLayouts**.

## Common commands

```bash
stencil --help
stencil debug
stencil start
stencil download -o
stencil pull
stencil bundle
stencil push          # upload only
stencil push -a       # upload + activate
node scripts/harvest-custom-layouts.js --apply   # refresh local customLayouts
node scripts/apply-homepage-ids.js staging       # patch home rail IDs for staging
node scripts/apply-homepage-ids.js prod          # restore committed prod IDs
```

Full command list + Helvetica cutover notes: `docs/agents/stencil-theme.md`.
